Keep a shared logs as an empty list of text.
Place "0:start:0" into logs.
Place "1:start:2" into logs.
Place "1:end:5" into logs.
Place "0:end:6" into logs.
Keep a shared stack as an empty list of whole numbers.
Keep a shared elapsed as an empty list of whole numbers.
Place 0 into elapsed.
Place 0 into elapsed.
Keep a shared field as empty text.
Keep a shared tally as 0.
Keep a shared parsed as 0.
Keep a shared prior as 0.
To read from spot (a whole number).
If spot is more than the last position of field, set parsed to tally, return.
The symbol is character spot of field.
If symbol is between "0" and "9".
The digit is the digit value of symbol.
Set tally to tally times 10 plus digit.
Read from spot plus 1.

To save from spot (a whole number) with amount (a whole number).
Set item spot of elapsed to item spot of elapsed plus amount.

To enter from worker (a whole number) with moment (a whole number).
The top is the last position of stack.
If top is at least 0, save from top with moment minus prior.
Place worker into stack.
Set prior to moment.

To exit from worker (a whole number) with moment (a whole number).
Set item worker of elapsed to item worker of elapsed plus moment minus prior plus 1.
Remove the last item from stack.
Set prior to moment plus 1.

For each entry in logs.
The fields is split entry by ":".
The event is item 1 of fields.
Set field to item 0 of fields.
Set tally to 0.
Read from 0.
The worker is parsed.
Set field to item 2 of fields.
Set tally to 0.
Read from 0.
The moment is parsed.
If event matches "start", enter from worker with moment.
If event matches "end", exit from worker with moment.

The firsttime is item 0 of elapsed.
The secondtime is item 1 of elapsed.
The report is empty text.
Place format whole number firsttime as text into report.
Place "," into report.
Place format whole number secondtime as text into report.
Show report.
